#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: claudiavalsells-content.php
msgid "Claudia Valsells — Content"
msgstr "Claudia Valsells — Contenido"

#. Description of the plugin
#: claudiavalsells-content.php
msgid ""
"The content types, fields, redirects and order desk of claudiavalsells.com. "
"The theme draws; this says what there is to draw."
msgstr ""
"Los tipos de contenido, los campos, las redirecciones y el formulario de "
"pedido de claudiavalsells.com. El tema dibuja; esto dice qué hay que dibujar."

#. Author of the plugin
#: claudiavalsells-content.php
msgid "Frank Llonch"
msgstr "Frank Llonch"

#: includes/editor.php:33
msgid "— not in the record"
msgstr "— no figura en el historial"

#: includes/editor.php:34
msgid "Solo exhibition"
msgstr "Exposición individual"

#: includes/editor.php:35
msgid "Group exhibition"
msgstr "Exposición colectiva"

#: includes/editor.php:36
msgid "Art fair"
msgstr "Feria de arte"

#: includes/editor.php:42
msgid "This work"
msgstr "Esta obra"

#: includes/editor.php:44 includes/editor.php:56 includes/editor.php:68
#: includes/editor.php:102 includes/post-types.php:302
msgid "Year"
msgstr "Año"

#: includes/editor.php:45
msgid "Dimensions"
msgstr "Medidas"

#: includes/editor.php:45
msgid "As it should read, e.g. 162 × 130 cm"
msgstr "Tal como debe aparecer, p. ej. 162 × 130 cm"

#: includes/editor.php:46
msgid "Materials"
msgstr "Materiales"

#: includes/editor.php:46
msgid "e.g. Acrylic on canvas"
msgstr "p. ej. Acrylic on canvas"

#: includes/editor.php:47
msgid "Inventory reference"
msgstr "Referencia de inventario"

#: includes/editor.php:47
msgid "Your own, e.g. L585. Not shown on the site."
msgstr "La tuya, p. ej. L585. No se muestra en el sitio."

#: includes/editor.php:48
msgid "Available"
msgstr "Disponible"

#: includes/editor.php:49
msgid "The picture shows the painting alone"
msgstr "La imagen muestra solo el cuadro"

#: includes/editor.php:49
msgid ""
"On: the grid can draw it to scale. Off for a photograph of a room with the "
"painting in it."
msgstr ""
"Activado: la cuadrícula puede dibujarlo a escala. Desactivado si es una "
"fotografía de una sala con el cuadro."

#: includes/editor.php:50
msgid "Photograph of the work in place"
msgstr "Fotografía de la obra instalada"

#: includes/editor.php:50
msgid ""
"The painting on the wall, if the main picture is a cut-out. Shown beside it "
"on the work’s page."
msgstr ""
"El cuadro en la pared, si la imagen principal es solo el cuadro recortado. "
"Se muestra a su lado en la página de la obra."

#: includes/editor.php:54
msgid "This project"
msgstr "Este proyecto"

#: includes/editor.php:56
msgid ""
"The year it began. A new project goes to the top of its group; the Order "
"field in the side panel moves it."
msgstr ""
"El año en que empezó. Un proyecto nuevo se coloca al principio de su grupo; "
"el campo Orden del panel lateral lo mueve."

#: includes/editor.php:57
msgid "When, as shown"
msgstr "Cuándo, tal como debe aparecer"

#: includes/editor.php:57
msgid "e.g. 2016 – 2020, or 2023 – Currently. Left empty, the year is shown."
msgstr ""
"p. ej. 2016 – 2020, o 2023 – Currently. Si se deja vacío, se muestra el año."

#: includes/editor.php:58
msgid "Client"
msgstr "Cliente"

#: includes/editor.php:59
msgid "Name on its page"
msgstr "Nombre en su página"

#: includes/editor.php:59
msgid ""
"The bold name at the top of the project’s page, e.g. Color Chart. Left "
"empty, the title above is used."
msgstr ""
"El nombre en negrita arriba de la página del proyecto, p. ej. Color Chart. "
"Si se deja vacío, se usa el título de arriba."

#: includes/editor.php:60
msgid "Under the name"
msgstr "Debajo del nombre"

#: includes/editor.php:60
msgid ""
"Who it was for or with, one line per line, written as it should read: FOR "
"NANI MARQUINA."
msgstr ""
"Para quién o con quién fue, una línea por línea, escrito tal como debe "
"leerse: FOR NANI MARQUINA."

#: includes/editor.php:61
msgid "When, on its page"
msgstr "Cuándo, en su página"

#: includes/editor.php:61
msgid "e.g. 2023 - ON GOING. Left empty, the same as in the list."
msgstr "p. ej. 2023 - ON GOING. Si se deja vacío, lo mismo que en la lista."

#: includes/editor.php:65
msgid "This exhibition"
msgstr "Esta exposición"

#: includes/editor.php:67
msgid "Where"
msgstr "Dónde"

#: includes/editor.php:67
msgid "e.g. Alzueta Gallery, Barcelona"
msgstr "p. ej. Alzueta Gallery, Barcelona"

#: includes/editor.php:69
msgid "From"
msgstr "Desde"

#: includes/editor.php:69
msgid "A month, or a month and a day: May 27"
msgstr "Un mes, o un mes y un día: May 27"

#: includes/editor.php:70
msgid "To"
msgstr "Hasta"

#: includes/editor.php:70
msgid "Only when it ran across months."
msgstr "Solo si abarcó varios meses."

#: includes/editor.php:71
msgid "Ended in year"
msgstr "Año en que terminó"

#: includes/editor.php:71
msgid "Only when it ran into another year."
msgstr "Solo si se prolongó hasta otro año."

#: includes/editor.php:72
msgid "In the record as"
msgstr "En el historial como"

#: includes/editor.php:72
msgid "Which column of About lists it."
msgstr "En qué columna de About aparece."

#: includes/editor.php:73
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: includes/editor.php:77
msgid "This edition"
msgstr "Esta edición"

#: includes/editor.php:79
msgid "Numeral"
msgstr "Número romano"

#: includes/editor.php:79
msgid "I, II, III…"
msgstr "I, II, III…"

#: includes/editor.php:80
msgid "Introduction on the opening page"
msgstr "Introducción en la página de apertura"

#: includes/editor.php:80
msgid ""
"Only if it should differ from the text above. Left empty, the opening page "
"shows the text above."
msgstr ""
"Solo si debe ser distinta del texto de arriba. Si se deja vacía, la página "
"de apertura muestra el texto de arriba."

#: includes/editor.php:81
msgid "Opening page: cut after"
msgstr "Página de inicio: cortar después de"

#: includes/editor.php:81
msgid ""
"The words the short version ends on, copied from the introduction. The rest "
"shows behind “Read more”. Left empty, the whole introduction shows."
msgstr ""
"Las palabras con las que termina la versión corta, copiadas de la "
"introducción. El resto aparece tras «Read more». Si se deja vacío, se "
"muestra la introducción entera."

#: includes/editor.php:82
msgid "Opening page: setting"
msgstr "Página de inicio: composición"

#: includes/editor.php:82
msgid "Ragged right"
msgstr "Alineado a la izquierda"

#: includes/editor.php:82
msgid "Justified"
msgstr "Justificado"

#: includes/editor.php:86
msgid "This person"
msgstr "Esta persona"

#: includes/editor.php:88
msgid "What they do"
msgstr "A qué se dedica"

#: includes/editor.php:89
msgid "Known as"
msgstr "Firma como"

#: includes/editor.php:89
msgid "The name they publish under, if different."
msgstr "El nombre con el que publica, si es distinto."

#: includes/editor.php:90
msgid "Colour reference"
msgstr "Referencia del color"

#: includes/editor.php:90
msgid "e.g. AC011"
msgstr "p. ej. AC011"

#: includes/editor.php:91
msgid "Colour name"
msgstr "Nombre del color"

#: includes/editor.php:91
msgid "e.g. Powder red"
msgstr "p. ej. Powder red"

#: includes/editor.php:92
msgid "Colour, as a hex value"
msgstr "Color, como valor hexadecimal"

#: includes/editor.php:92
msgid ""
"e.g. #d98f93. Left empty, the colour comes from the colour reference, or "
"else from the colour’s name."
msgstr ""
"p. ej. #d98f93. Si se deja vacío, el color se toma de la referencia del "
"color o, si no la hay, de su nombre."

#: includes/editor.php:93
msgid "Answered in images"
msgstr "Respondió con imágenes"

#: includes/editor.php:99
msgid "The card"
msgstr "La tarjeta"

#: includes/editor.php:101
msgid "City"
msgstr "Ciudad"

#: includes/editor.php:102
msgid "The year under her name on the card."
msgstr "El año que aparece bajo su nombre en la tarjeta."

#: includes/editor.php:103
msgid "Phone"
msgstr "Teléfono"

#: includes/editor.php:104
msgid "Emails"
msgstr "Correos electrónicos"

#: includes/editor.php:104
msgid "One per line."
msgstr "Uno por línea."

#: includes/editor.php:105
msgid "Private collections"
msgstr "Colecciones privadas"

#: includes/editor.php:105
msgid "One per line: Name | Place"
msgstr "Una por línea: Nombre | Lugar"

#: includes/editor.php:106
msgid "Closing line"
msgstr "Línea de cierre"

#: includes/editor.php:110
msgid "The chart"
msgstr "La carta"

#: includes/editor.php:112
msgid "Price"
msgstr "Precio"

#: includes/editor.php:112
msgid "As it should read, e.g. 60,50€"
msgstr "Tal como debe aparecer, p. ej. 60,50€"

#: includes/editor.php:113
msgid "The bands"
msgstr "Las franjas"

#: includes/editor.php:113
msgid "One colour per line, as a hex value, top to bottom."
msgstr "Un color por línea, como valor hexadecimal, de arriba abajo."

#: includes/editor.php:130
msgid "Statement, in capitals"
msgstr "Declaración, en mayúsculas"

#: includes/editor.php:131
msgid "Credits, smaller"
msgstr "Créditos, más pequeños"

#: includes/editor.php:132
msgid "Call to act, leaning"
msgstr "Llamada a la acción, en cursiva"

#: includes/environment.php:55
msgid "Staging — not the live site"
msgstr "Pruebas (staging) — no es el sitio real"

#: includes/environment.php:56
msgid "Development — not the live site"
msgstr "Desarrollo — no es el sitio real"

#: includes/environment.php:57
msgid "Local copy — not the live site"
msgstr "Copia local — no es el sitio real"

#: includes/guide.php:30 includes/guide.php:43
msgid "How to…"
msgstr "Cómo hacer…"

#: includes/guide.php:35 includes/guide.php:86
msgid "Guide"
msgstr "Guía"

#: includes/guide.php:44
msgid "Print, or save as PDF"
msgstr "Imprimir o guardar como PDF"

#. translators: 1: the Dashboard menu, 2: the guide's own page in it, a link to it.
#: includes/guide.php:83
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The whole guide is also under %1$s → %2$s, to read on one page or to print."
msgstr ""
"La guía completa también está en %1$s → %2$s, para leerla en una sola página "
"o imprimirla."

#: includes/guide.php:96
msgid "The things you will do most often, a few steps each."
msgstr "Lo que harás más a menudo, cada cosa en unos pocos pasos."

#: includes/guide.php:97
msgid "Words in bold are what the screen says: a menu, a button or a field."
msgstr ""
"Las palabras en negrita son las que aparecen en pantalla: un menú, un botón "
"o un campo."

#: includes/guide.php:100
msgid "In the editor, the fields of an entry are in the panel on the right."
msgstr ""
"En el editor, los campos de cada ficha están en el panel de la derecha."

#. translators: “Settings” is the editor's own button that opens its side panel; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:103
msgid ""
"If it is closed, press <strong>Settings</strong> at the top right to open it."
msgstr ""
"Si está cerrado, pulsa <strong>Ajustes</strong> arriba a la derecha para "
"abrirlo."

#: includes/guide.php:121
msgid "Add a painting"
msgstr "Añadir un cuadro"

#: includes/guide.php:124
msgid ""
"Have the picture ready first: the painting alone, cut out of its photograph "
"and saved as a PNG with a transparent background, so that it sits on the "
"page with nothing around it."
msgstr ""
"Ten preparada antes la imagen: el cuadro solo, recortado de su fotografía y "
"guardado como PNG con fondo transparente, para que quede en la página sin "
"nada alrededor."

#: includes/guide.php:125
msgid "A photograph with the wall around it looks wrong in the grid."
msgstr "Una fotografía con la pared alrededor queda mal en la cuadrícula."

#. translators: “Add title” is what the editor shows in an empty title; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:132
msgid "Type the painting’s title where it says <strong>Add title</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Escribe el título del cuadro donde pone <strong>Escribe un título</strong>."

#. translators: 1: the tab of the editor's side panel that holds the entry's own fields, 2: a button on it.
#: includes/guide.php:137
#, php-format
msgid "In the panel on the right, on the %1$s tab, press %2$s."
msgstr "En el panel de la derecha, en la pestaña %1$s, pulsa %2$s."

#. translators: %s: the same button, which the window that opens repeats.
#: includes/guide.php:143
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Drag the PNG into the window that opens, then press %s again at its bottom "
"right."
msgstr ""
"Arrastra el PNG a la ventana que se abre y pulsa de nuevo %s, abajo a la "
"derecha de la ventana."

#. translators: 1: a panel of fields in the editor, 2–5: four of its fields.
#: includes/guide.php:150
#, php-format
msgid "Further down, under %1$s, fill in %2$s, %3$s, %4$s and %5$s."
msgstr "Más abajo, en %1$s, rellena %2$s, %3$s, %4$s y %5$s."

#: includes/guide.php:157
msgid ""
"Write the dimensions with × or x between the two sides, as in 100 × 80 cm: "
"the grid reads them to draw the painting to scale."
msgstr ""
"Escribe las medidas con × o x entre los dos lados, como en 100 × 80 cm: la "
"cuadrícula las lee para dibujar el cuadro a escala."

#. translators: %s: a switch in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:161
#, php-format
msgid "Switch %s on if the painting is for sale."
msgstr "Activa %s si el cuadro está a la venta."

#. translators: %s: a switch in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:167
#, php-format
msgid "Leave %s switched on: it lets the grid draw the painting to scale."
msgstr "No desactives %s: así la cuadrícula puede dibujar el cuadro a escala."

#: includes/guide.php:170
msgid ""
"Switch it off only if the picture is a photograph of a room with the "
"painting in it."
msgstr ""
"Desactívalo solo si la imagen es una fotografía de una sala con el cuadro."

#. translators: 1: a field in the editor's side panel, 2: its button. “Select” is the button of WordPress's media window; write it as WordPress shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:175
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Under %1$s, press %2$s, choose or upload the photograph of the painting on "
"the wall, and press <strong>Select</strong>."
msgstr ""
"En %1$s, pulsa %2$s, elige o sube la fotografía del cuadro en la pared y "
"pulsa <strong>Seleccionar</strong>."

#: includes/guide.php:178 admin/editor.js:63
msgid "Choose photograph"
msgstr "Elegir la fotografía"

#: includes/guide.php:180
msgid "It is shown with the cut-out on the painting’s page."
msgstr "Aparece junto al cuadro recortado en la página del cuadro."

#. translators: %s: the button the editor offers once the entry is published.
#: includes/guide.php:186
#, php-format
msgid "To see it on the site, press %s in the panel that follows."
msgstr ""
"Para verlo en el sitio, pulsa %s en el panel que aparece a continuación."

#. translators: %s: the address of the site's Artwork page.
#: includes/guide.php:191
#, php-format
msgid ""
"It is also on <a href=\"%s\">the artwork page</a>, among the works of its "
"year."
msgstr ""
"También está en <a href=\"%s\">la página Artwork</a>, entre las obras de su "
"año."

#: includes/guide.php:200
msgid "Mark a painting available or sold"
msgstr "Marcar un cuadro como disponible o vendido"

#. translators: %s: the search button above the list of works.
#: includes/guide.php:206
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Find the painting: type its title in the box at the top right and press %s."
msgstr ""
"Busca el cuadro: escribe su título en el campo de arriba a la derecha y "
"pulsa %s."

#: includes/guide.php:209
msgid "Click its title to open it."
msgstr "Haz clic en su título para abrirlo."

#. translators: 1: a panel of fields in the editor, 2: a switch in it.
#: includes/guide.php:213
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the panel on the right, under %1$s, switch %2$s on while the painting is "
"for sale and off once it has sold."
msgstr ""
"En el panel de la derecha, en %1$s, activa %2$s mientras el cuadro esté a la "
"venta y desactívalo cuando se haya vendido."

#: includes/guide.php:220
msgid "A sold painting stays on the site with all the others."
msgstr "Un cuadro vendido sigue en el sitio con todos los demás."

#: includes/guide.php:227
msgid "Add an exhibition"
msgstr "Añadir una exposición"

#. translators: “Add title” is what the editor shows in an empty title; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:232
msgid "Type the exhibition’s title where it says <strong>Add title</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Escribe el título de la exposición donde pone <strong>Escribe un título</"
"strong>."

#. translators: 1: a panel of fields in the editor, 2–4: three of its fields.
#: includes/guide.php:237
#, php-format
msgid "In the panel on the right, under %1$s, fill in %2$s, %3$s and %4$s."
msgstr "En el panel de la derecha, en %1$s, rellena %2$s, %3$s y %4$s."

#. translators: 1, 2: fields in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:245
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Fill in %1$s only if it ran across months, and %2$s only if it ran into "
"another year."
msgstr ""
"Rellena %1$s solo si abarcó varios meses, y %2$s solo si se prolongó hasta "
"otro año."

#. translators: 1: a field in the editor's side panel, 2–4: its choices.
#: includes/guide.php:253
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s decides which column of About lists the show: %2$s, %3$s or %4$s."
msgstr ""
"El campo %1$s decide en qué columna de About aparece la exposición: %2$s, "
"%3$s o %4$s."

#. translators: %s: the choice that keeps a show off the About page.
#: includes/guide.php:261
#, php-format
msgid "Choose %s to leave it out of About."
msgstr "Elige %s para que no aparezca en About."

#: includes/guide.php:265
msgid ""
"If there is a text about the show, write it in the large space below the "
"title."
msgstr ""
"Si hay un texto sobre la exposición, escríbelo en el espacio grande debajo "
"del título."

#: includes/guide.php:267
msgid "A new exhibition goes to the top of the list."
msgstr "Una exposición nueva se coloca al principio de la lista."

#: includes/guide.php:271
msgid ""
"A show with a text opens on the reading sheet, the text beside its "
"photographs."
msgstr ""
"Una exposición con texto se abre en la hoja de lectura, con el texto junto a "
"sus fotografías."

#: includes/guide.php:272
msgid ""
"A show with photographs and no text opens on the photographs sheet, the "
"photographs alone."
msgstr ""
"Una exposición con fotografías y sin texto se abre en la hoja de "
"fotografías, solo con las fotografías."

#: includes/guide.php:273
msgid "A show with neither stays a line in the list, with nothing to open."
msgstr ""
"Una exposición sin texto ni fotografías se queda en una línea de la lista, "
"sin nada que abrir."

#: includes/guide.php:282
msgid "Add a commissioned project"
msgstr "Añadir un proyecto de encargo"

#. translators: “Add title” is what the editor shows in an empty title; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:287
msgid ""
"Type the project’s title, as its line in the list should read, where it says "
"<strong>Add title</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Escribe el título del proyecto, tal como debe leerse su línea en la lista, "
"donde pone <strong>Escribe un título</strong>."

#. translators: 1: a panel in the editor's side panel, 2: the groups it offers, as a list.
#: includes/guide.php:291
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the panel on the right, under %1$s, tick the group it belongs to: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"En el panel de la derecha, en %1$s, marca el grupo al que pertenece: %2$s."

#. translators: 1: a panel of fields in the editor, 2, 3: two of its fields.
#: includes/guide.php:297
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Under %1$s, fill in %2$s, the year it began, and %3$s, the dates as the list "
"shows them."
msgstr ""
"En %1$s, rellena %2$s, el año en que empezó, y %3$s, las fechas tal como las "
"muestra la lista."

#. translators: 1–3: fields in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:305
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Its own page opens with a heading that can differ from the list: %1$s, %2$s "
"and %3$s."
msgstr ""
"Su propia página empieza con un encabezado que puede ser distinto del de la "
"lista: %1$s, %2$s y %3$s."

#: includes/guide.php:310
msgid ""
"Write each as it should read there, the lines under the name one per line: "
"FOR NANI MARQUINA."
msgstr ""
"Escribe cada uno tal como debe leerse allí, y las líneas debajo del nombre, "
"una por línea: FOR NANI MARQUINA."

#: includes/guide.php:311
msgid "Left empty, the page uses the title and the dates of the list."
msgstr "Si se dejan vacíos, la página usa el título y las fechas de la lista."

#: includes/guide.php:315
msgid "Write the text below the title."
msgstr "Escribe el texto debajo del título."

#. translators: 1–3: the names of the paragraph styles. “Block” and “Styles” are the editor's own words for its side panel; write them as the editor shows them in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:318
#, php-format
msgid ""
"To set a paragraph as the designer does, click it, then in the panel on the "
"right, on the <strong>Block</strong> tab, under <strong>Styles</strong>, "
"choose %1$s, %2$s or %3$s."
msgstr ""
"Para componer un párrafo como en el diseño, haz clic en él y, en el panel de "
"la derecha, en la pestaña <strong>Bloque</strong>, en <strong>Estilos</"
"strong>, elige %1$s, %2$s o %3$s."

#: includes/guide.php:323
msgid ""
"A project’s text usually opens with a statement in capitals and ends with "
"its credits, set smaller."
msgstr ""
"El texto de un proyecto suele empezar con una declaración en mayúsculas y "
"terminar con los créditos, en letra más pequeña."

#: includes/guide.php:325
msgid "A new project goes to the top of its group."
msgstr "Un proyecto nuevo se coloca al principio de su grupo."

#: includes/guide.php:331
msgid "Add a person to What’s Color?"
msgstr "Añadir una persona a What’s Color?"

#. translators: 1: a menu in the column on the left of the admin, 2: one of its items, a link to it, 3: the button above the list it opens, a link to it.
#: includes/guide.php:335
#, php-format
msgid "In the menu on the left, go to %1$s → %2$s and press %3$s at the top."
msgstr ""
"En el menú de la izquierda, ve a %1$s → %2$s y pulsa %3$s en la parte "
"superior."

#. translators: “Add title” is what the editor shows in an empty title; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:342
msgid "Type their name where it says <strong>Add title</strong>."
msgstr "Escribe su nombre donde pone <strong>Escribe un título</strong>."

#. translators: 1: a panel in the editor's side panel, 2: the editions it offers, as a list.
#: includes/guide.php:346
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the panel on the right, under %1$s, tick the edition they answered in: "
"%2$s."
msgstr ""
"En el panel de la derecha, en %1$s, marca la edición en la que respondió: "
"%2$s."

#. translators: 1: a panel of fields in the editor, 2, 3: two of its fields.
#: includes/guide.php:352
#, php-format
msgid "Under %1$s, fill in %2$s, and %3$s if they publish under another name."
msgstr "En %1$s, rellena %2$s, y %3$s si publica con otro nombre."

#. translators: 1, 2: fields in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:360
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Fill in %1$s and %2$s with the colour of their answer, for example AC011 and "
"Powder red."
msgstr ""
"Rellena %1$s y %2$s con el color de su respuesta, por ejemplo AC011 y Powder "
"red."

#. translators: %s: a field in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:366
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s can stay empty: the site then finds the colour from the reference or the "
"name."
msgstr ""
"No hace falta rellenar %s: en ese caso el sitio deduce el color de la "
"referencia o del nombre."

#: includes/guide.php:371
msgid "Write their answer, as they gave it, in the large space below the name."
msgstr ""
"Escribe su respuesta, tal como la dio, en el espacio grande debajo del "
"nombre."

#. translators: %s: a switch in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:374
#, php-format
msgid "If they answered in pictures rather than words, switch on %s."
msgstr "Si respondió con imágenes en lugar de con palabras, activa %s."

#: includes/guide.php:382
msgid ""
"Once published with an answer, their name joins the edition’s names on the "
"home page and on the edition’s own page."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se publica con una respuesta, su nombre se suma a los de la edición "
"en la portada y en la página de la propia edición."

#: includes/guide.php:383
msgid ""
"On the edition’s page they come after the people the designer has placed, "
"until the page is redrawn."
msgstr ""
"En la página de la edición aparece después de las personas ya colocadas en "
"el diseño, hasta que la página se vuelva a diseñar."

#: includes/guide.php:384
msgid ""
"The people already on the page are placed by their names, so keep their "
"names as they are."
msgstr ""
"Las personas que ya están en la página se colocan por su nombre, así que no "
"cambies sus nombres."

#: includes/guide.php:396
msgid "Edit About"
msgstr "Editar About"

#. translators: 1: a panel of fields in the editor, 2–5: its fields.
#: includes/guide.php:401
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The card is in the panel on the right, under %1$s: %2$s, %3$s, %4$s and "
"%5$s, one email per line."
msgstr ""
"La tarjeta está en el panel de la derecha, en %1$s: %2$s, %3$s, %4$s y %5$s, "
"con un correo electrónico por línea."

#. translators: %s: a field in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:410
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The collections are there too, under %s: one per line, the name and the "
"place with a vertical bar between them, as in Fundació Vilacases | Barcelona."
msgstr ""
"Las colecciones también están ahí, en %s: una por línea, el nombre y el "
"lugar separados por una barra vertical, como en Fundació Vilacases | "
"Barcelona."

#: includes/guide.php:414
msgid ""
"The biography is the text of the page: click into a paragraph to change it."
msgstr ""
"La biografía es el texto de la página: haz clic en un párrafo para cambiarlo."

#. translators: “Replace” is the editor's own button above a selected image; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:417
msgid ""
"The studio photographs are images between the paragraphs: click one and "
"press <strong>Replace</strong> to change it."
msgstr ""
"Las fotografías del estudio son imágenes entre los párrafos: haz clic en una "
"y pulsa <strong>Reemplazar</strong> para cambiarla."

#. translators: 1: the Exhibitions menu, 2: a field of each exhibition.
#: includes/guide.php:422
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The exhibitions on About are not typed here: they come from %1$s, each in "
"the column its %2$s says."
msgstr ""
"Las exposiciones de About no se escriben aquí: salen de %1$s, cada una en la "
"columna que indique su campo %2$s."

#: includes/guide.php:435
msgid "Change the Color Chart’s price and texts"
msgstr "Cambiar el precio y los textos de la Carta de color"

#. translators: 1: a panel of fields in the editor, 2: one of its fields.
#: includes/guide.php:440
#, php-format
msgid ""
"In the panel on the right, under %1$s, change %2$s, written as it should "
"read: 60,50€."
msgstr ""
"En el panel de la derecha, en %1$s, cambia %2$s, tal como debe aparecer: "
"60,50€."

#: includes/guide.php:444
msgid ""
"The text beside the chart is the text of the page: click into it to change "
"it."
msgstr ""
"El texto junto a la carta es el texto de la página: haz clic en él para "
"cambiarlo."

#. translators: %s: a field in the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:447
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s are the chart’s colours, top to bottom: leave them as they are unless the "
"chart itself changes."
msgstr ""
"%s son los colores de la carta, de arriba abajo: déjalos como están, salvo "
"que cambie la propia carta."

#: includes/guide.php:460 includes/settings.php:64 includes/settings.php:65
#: includes/settings.php:69
msgid "Site texts"
msgstr "Textos del sitio"

#: includes/guide.php:464 includes/guide.php:503
msgid "Where the order form’s messages go"
msgstr "Adónde van los mensajes del formulario de pedido"

#. translators: 1: a part of the Site texts page, 2: its field.
#: includes/guide.php:470
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Under %1$s, %2$s is the address every message from the Color Chart’s order "
"form is sent to."
msgstr ""
"En %1$s, el campo %2$s es la dirección a la que se envía cada mensaje del "
"formulario de pedido de la Carta de color."

#: includes/guide.php:471 includes/settings.php:37
msgid "The order desk"
msgstr "El formulario de pedido"

#: includes/guide.php:472 includes/settings.php:58
msgid "Send inquiries to"
msgstr "Enviar las consultas a"

#: includes/guide.php:474
msgid "It never appears on the site."
msgstr "Nunca aparece en el sitio."

#. translators: %s: a field of the Site texts page.
#: includes/guide.php:478
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%s is the most messages the form sends in a day, a guard against a flood."
msgstr ""
"El campo %s indica el máximo de mensajes que el formulario envía en un día, "
"como protección contra una avalancha."

#: includes/guide.php:479 includes/settings.php:59
msgid "At most, per day"
msgstr "Como máximo, al día"

#. translators: “Save Changes” is WordPress's own button at the foot of a settings page; write it as WordPress shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:483
msgid "Press <strong>Save Changes</strong> at the foot of the page."
msgstr "Pulsa <strong>Guardar cambios</strong> al pie de la página."

#: includes/guide.php:488
msgid ""
"Each message arrives as an email, and nothing of it is kept on the site."
msgstr ""
"Cada mensaje llega como un correo electrónico, y no se guarda nada de él en "
"el sitio."

#: includes/guide.php:489
msgid "Reply to it as to any email: the answer goes to the person who wrote."
msgstr ""
"Responde como a cualquier otro correo: la respuesta le llega a la persona "
"que lo escribió."

#. translators: 1–3: fields of the Site texts page.
#: includes/guide.php:493
#, php-format
msgid "The same page holds the site’s other texts: %1$s, %2$s and %3$s."
msgstr ""
"En la misma página están los demás textos del sitio: %1$s, %2$s y %3$s."

#: includes/guide.php:494 includes/settings.php:55
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descripción"

#: includes/guide.php:495 includes/settings.php:56
msgid "What’s Color? — the note above the names"
msgstr "What’s Color? — la nota encima de los nombres"

#: includes/guide.php:496 includes/settings.php:57
msgid "The opening screen"
msgstr "La pantalla de inicio"

#. translators: 1: a menu in the column on the left of the admin, 2: one of its items.
#: includes/guide.php:507
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Messages from the Color Chart’s order form arrive by email, at the address "
"set in %1$s → %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Los mensajes del formulario de pedido de la Carta de color llegan por correo "
"electrónico a la dirección indicada en %1$s → %2$s."

#: includes/guide.php:511
msgid "Only an administrator can see that page and change the address."
msgstr "Solo un administrador puede ver esa página y cambiar la dirección."

#: includes/guide.php:519
msgid "Before you publish"
msgstr "Antes de publicar"

#. translators: “View” and “Preview in new tab” are the editor's own button and menu item; write them as the editor shows them in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:523
msgid ""
"To see an entry as the site will show it, before anyone else can, press "
"<strong>View</strong> at the top right and choose <strong>Preview in new "
"tab</strong>."
msgstr ""
"Para ver una ficha tal como la mostrará el sitio, antes de que nadie más "
"pueda verla, pulsa <strong>Ver</strong> arriba a la derecha y elige "
"<strong>Previsualizar en nueva pestaña</strong>."

#. translators: “Save draft” is the editor's own button; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:527
msgid "<strong>Save draft</strong> keeps your work without publishing it."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Guardar como borrador</strong> guarda tu trabajo sin publicarlo."

#: includes/guide.php:530
msgid "A painting’s year and its picture decide where it appears."
msgstr "El año y la imagen de un cuadro deciden dónde aparece."

#: includes/guide.php:531
msgid ""
"The works run from the newest year to the oldest, so the year places it in "
"the grid; a painting saved without a year is given the current one."
msgstr ""
"Las obras van del año más reciente al más antiguo, así que el año lo sitúa "
"en la cuadrícula; a un cuadro guardado sin año se le asigna el año actual."

#: includes/guide.php:532
msgid "Without a picture, it is not shown in the grid at all."
msgstr "Sin imagen, no aparece en la cuadrícula."

#. translators: 1: a menu in the column on the left of the admin, 2: one of its items, a link to the screen it opens.
#: includes/guide.php:558
#, php-format
msgid "In the menu on the left, go to %1$s → %2$s."
msgstr "En el menú de la izquierda, ve a %1$s → %2$s."

#. translators: 1: the Pages menu, 2: its first item, 3: the page to click, a link to it.
#: includes/guide.php:568
#, php-format
msgid "In the menu on the left, go to %1$s → %2$s and click %3$s."
msgstr "En el menú de la izquierda, ve a %1$s → %2$s y haz clic en %3$s."

#. translators: “Publish” is the editor's own button, at the top right and again in the panel that asks to confirm; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:578
msgid ""
"Press <strong>Publish</strong> at the top right, and <strong>Publish</"
"strong> again to confirm."
msgstr ""
"Pulsa <strong>Publicar</strong> arriba a la derecha, y de nuevo "
"<strong>Publicar</strong> para confirmar."

#. translators: “Save” is the editor's own button for an entry already published; write it as the editor shows it in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:585
msgid "Press <strong>Save</strong> at the top right."
msgstr "Pulsa <strong>Guardar</strong> arriba a la derecha."

#. translators: %s: the button for the entry's main photograph, at the top of the editor's side panel.
#: includes/guide.php:593
#, php-format
msgid ""
"At the top of the panel, press %s: the list shows that photograph, and its "
"page opens on it."
msgstr ""
"En la parte superior del panel, pulsa %s: la lista muestra esa fotografía, y "
"su página empieza por ella."

#. translators: /image and /gallery are typed on an empty line of the editor to add an Image or a Gallery block; give the blocks' names as the editor does in this language.
#: includes/guide.php:600
msgid ""
"Add more photographs in the text: on an empty line, type /image or /gallery "
"and press Enter."
msgstr ""
"Añade más fotografías en el texto: en una línea vacía, escribe /imagen o /"
"galería y pulsa Intro."

